  "releaseNotes": "- [Sg] Heap: fixed cluster bulk-ingest regression — building a large scene accumulated one dirty range per added slot, turning the first ClassSlots flush into a million-upload storm (Vienna full-city first frame 121 -> 179 s on 0035). Past 2048 sparse ranges the flush collapses to ONE full rewrite; surviving sparse ranges sort + gap-merge like the draw mirror. Steady-state edits stay O(changed).",
